<<<
incomprehension. 1. Socratic irony was a profession of ignorance.
===
incomprehension. 1. *Socratic irony* was a profession of ignorance.
>>>

<<<
simplicity. 2. The double audience is essential too to what is called dramatic irony, i.e. the irony of the Greek drama.
===
simplicity. 2. The double audience is essential too to what is called *dramatic irony*, i.e. the irony of the Greek drama.
>>>
